# Source audio masters — NOT committed.
# ~50 MB of MP3 that never ships (they are ~20x the F-05 budget); public/audio/
# holds the transcoded variants that do. Re-records are expected, so keeping the
# binaries out of git avoids permanent bloat.
#
# Restore with:
#   cp "D:/MeraHaq/drive-download-20260816T114815Z-1-001/"*.mp3 resources/audio/
#   node scripts/inventory-resources.mjs
#
# The authoritative filename -> card mapping lives in resources/MANIFEST.md.
*.mp3
!.gitignore
